            "review_title": "Review at Zigzag",
            "review_text": "Amanda W\nSanctuary Point, Australia29 contributions\n0\nA nice surprise in a quieter street of Hanoi\nJan 2014 • Family\nWe were exploring on foot and feeling a bit peckish when we came across a sign on the footpath featuring menu items which appealed to us. We chose to be seated outdoors in a narrow walkway which was quite comfortable. Indoor seating was also available. \n\nThe staff were extremely enthusiastic and the food was great. The facilities were clean and the prices were low. We would definitely eat there again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 26, 2014",
